  "descriptionNightEn": "Function \"Straight section\" leads to an obstacle and lights the lamps. Function \"Turn\": right, and if there is an obstacle ahead — turn the robot left. Walk 5 sections.",
  "descriptionEn": "The snake bends right and left, and its straight sections have different lengths. A straight section and a turn with a check are two functions.",
